        "candidate_id": "C_3e6e967c2b56e809_0",
        "edit": "Removed stray blank/whitespace-only lines inside the always block that left the if/else statement outside the intended procedural block body; the if/else is now the sole statement of the always block, restoring correct combinational mux behavior.",
